File: smart-dash-comment.l4
  Hidden: no
  Range: 18:1-18:2
  Source: lexer
  Severity: DiagnosticSeverity_Error
  Code: <none>
  Message:
    This character looks like `-`, but it is a different, similar-looking character: En Dash (U+2013).

    This usually happens when text is pasted in from a word processor — Word, Pages or Google Docs — which silently swaps plain punctuation for a fancier-looking lookalike as you type.

    Replace it with `-`. (or with `--`, if this was meant to start a comment)
